## DESCRIPTION
## Imported Genetics source row ce62_79f3; static curriculum staging source.
## ENDDESCRIPTION
## KEYWORDS('genetics','imported-curriculum')
## DBsubject('Genetics')
## Author('Neil R. Voss; imported from source/topic01/bbq-MATCH-genetic_disorders-questions.txt')
